POSTERIFLOW — SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE
=================================

PosteriFlow trains LeanNPE, an amortized neural posterior estimator. Given
4 s of whitened strain from LIGO Hanford (H1), LIGO Livingston (L1) and Virgo
(V1), one forward pass returns the posterior over 11 parameters of the k-th
loudest compact-binary signal in the window. Overlapping signals are handled
by querying k = 0, 1, 2, ... in turn.

